<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    KernelExtensions 多语言示例词条 - 简体中文
    Example locale file for KernelExtensions - Simplified Chinese

    把本文件复制到扩展根目录的 Locales 文件夹（扩展根目录/Locales/）即可让
    XMLExamples 中的 ExampleTrial.xml 与 MyAttack.xml 按玩家语言显示文本。
    Copy this file into your extension's Locales folder (ExtensionRoot/Locales/)
    to make ExampleTrial.xml and MyAttack.xml display text in the player's language.

    注意：此文件只包含示例用词条；KernelExtensions 自身 UI 的完整词条见
    仓库根目录 Locales/ 下的 en-us.xml / zh-cn.xml。
    Note: this file only contains example keys; the mod's own UI terms live in
    the repo-root Locales/en-us.xml and Locales/zh-cn.xml.
-->
